  <content>
  <section><title>Technology for Best Fitting Lines</title>
<para>Scientists are interested in finding out how different species adapt to finding food sources. One group studied crocodilians to find out how their bite force was related to body mass and diet. The table below displays the information they collected on body mass (in pounds) and bite force (in pounds). </para>

