<example><exercise>
  <problem>
  
    <para>Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.
    </para>
  </problem><solution>
  <para>Compare your answer: Here is how to find the line of best fit.</para>
  <para>Enter the number of years and the mean time into your technology:</para>
  <table class="os-raise-horizontaltable">
