  <para>Create a scatter plot and line of best fit. </para>

<figure><media alt="A SCATTER PLOT THAT SHOWS YEAR ON THE X-AXIS AND MEAN TIME IN SECONDS ON THE Y-AXIS. THE LINE DRAWN DECREASES FROM LEFT TO RI"><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/1cfcd300b11689890bcea2cdd3c14d2823f6f093"/></media></figure><para>The equation of the line of best fit, using technology, is \(y = -0.01x+10.2\).</para>
  
</solution></exercise>
